# Vercel Web Analytics Installation Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics has already been successfully installed and configured in this project. The implementation was completed in a previous PR (#33).

## Current Configuration Status

### 1. Package Installation ✅
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version `^2.0.1`
- **Location**: Listed in `package.json` dependencies
- **Status**: Already installed and present in lock file

### 2. Analytics Component Integration ✅
- **File Modified**: `frontend/app/layout.tsx`
- **Import Statement**: `import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";`
- **Component Placement**: `<Analytics />` component added in the root layout, inside the `<body>` tag, following all provider components
- **Status**: Correctly implemented according to official Vercel documentation

### 3. Framework Compatibility ✅
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.3.1 with App Router
- **Implementation**: Follows Next.js App Router best practices
- **Location**: Root layout file (`app/layout.tsx`)

## Documentation Verification
Fetched latest documentation from: https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart
- Confirmed the implementation matches the official Next.js App Router instructions
- Import path: `@vercel/analytics/next` ✅
- Component usage: `<Analytics />` in layout.tsx ✅
- No additional configuration required ✅

## Testing & Verification

### Build Status ✅
- TypeScript compilation: Successful
