## Implementation Details
The Analytics component is correctly placed at the end of the body tag, which ensures:
1. It doesn't block page rendering
2. It has access to all route changes in the Next.js App Router
3. It follows Vercel's recommended implementation pattern

## Deployment Readiness
The project is ready for deployment with Vercel Web Analytics enabled. Once deployed to Vercel, the Analytics dashboard will automatically begin tracking:
- Page views
- Route transitions
- Visitor metrics
- Web Vitals data

